<title>CANADA: Norcen Superior Income issue nets C$235 mln.</title>
<headline>Norcen Superior Income issue nets C$235 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norcen Energy Resources Ltd said on Tuesday it closed its sale of 22.8 million units of the new Superior Propane Income Fund for gross proceeds of C$250 million.</p>
<p>Units were priced at C$10.95 each.</p>
<p>Norcen said net proceeds of C$235 million have been used by the fund to buy a 50 percent interest in Norcen unit Superior Propane Inc.  </p>
<p>Under the arrangement, Norcen retains the other 50 percent of the propane marketer and will continue to manage the business.</p>
<p>Norcen said it would redeploy proceeds from the offering in its oil and gas business.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
